  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "I feel so good that I'm back to this place ",
      "where I was last year. I have wandered to",
      "every corner through the continent, collecting",
      "Monster Crystals.",
      "",
      "But, it is so hard for me as a tender woman ",
      "to collect the high level monster crystals. ",
      "All I can do is to get a few of them just ",
      "around the town. I got 5 kinds of Crystals ",
      "now, and I would be very happy if you can ",
      "give me the rest.",
      " ",
      "They say that there are 12 kinds of Monster ",
      "Crystal in Priston continent, could you get ",
      "and bring the other remaining crystal to me.",
      "",
      "Then, I will give you a great present.",
      "",
      "Thank you and hope to see you soon!"
    ]
  },
